    <string-array name="fasting_tips">
        <item>Stay hydrated and plan your meals ahead of time. Choose nutritious, filling foods when you can eat, and listen to your body throughout the fast.</item>
        <item>Water, black coffee and plain tea are usually fine during a fast. Sip regularly through the day.</item>
        <item>Break your fast gently with a balanced meal rather than a very large or sugary one.</item>
        <item>Feeling dizzy, faint or unwell? End your fast and eat something. Your health comes first.</item>
        <item>Ease in: start with shorter fasts and lengthen them gradually as your body adjusts.</item>
    </string-array>
